---
title: Batch Transaction Processing Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
  %% Generated by 6_diagram agent — sequence-builder skill
  %% Flow: BCHCTL00 batch job entry point

  participant JCL as Batch Job
  participant MAIN as BCHCTL00\nBatch Control
  participant VALID as Validation\nLogic
  participant DB as DB2\nDatabase
  participant ERR as ERRPROC\nError Handler

  JCL->>MAIN: Execute batch job
  Note over MAIN: BR-001: Validate transaction rules
  
  loop For each transaction
    MAIN->>DB: Read transaction record
    alt Transaction is valid
      MAIN->>DB: Update account balance
      Note over MAIN: BR-004: Route by type
      alt Credit transaction
        MAIN->>VALID: Validate credit limits
        VALID-->>MAIN: OK
      else Debit transaction
        MAIN->>VALID: Enforce limit checks
        VALID-->>MAIN: OK
      end
    else Invalid transaction
      MAIN->>ERR: Log error
      ERR-->>MAIN: Return
    end
  end

  MAIN->>DB: Commit changes
  MAIN->>MAIN: Terminate
